{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1122209-knockout-artist-question-hurt-locker-boxing-style","id":1122209,"title":"Knockout Artist Question (Hurt Locker Boxing Style)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-07-28T21:24:07-07:00","id":1122209,"title":"Knockout Artist Question (Hurt Locker Boxing Style)","content":"According to The Hurt Locker, the Knockout Artist ability (Boxing 3) treats the size of the target as 1 lower to reflect the character's casual ability to punch people in the head. However, inflicting the Stunned Tilt only works if you attack the head and attacking the head does not reduce the target's size for these purposes (it used to in GMC, but that's been changed). So how does Knockout Artist work?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5387-peteman","name":"Peteman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-29T04:58:39-07:00","id":1122296,"title":"","content":"I think with Stun you're going to have to houserule exactly how it works and modify merits and equipment that use it because there's been what, three, four different versions between previews and official releases and they don't sync up at all.<br /> <br /> Originally equipment with the stun tag doubled its bonus... but the only weapon with that tag had a bonus of 0 so it did nothing. Then it lowered the threshold by one. Then it was back to doubling and now it's on sledgehammers, which will always stun on a successful hit.<br /> <br /> If you want to keep the merit simple you could just keep the lower stun threshold on headshots by one bit. Alternatively, have it reduce the penalty for headshots from -3 to -1.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5328-helmsderp","name":"HelmsDerp","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"652"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-25T06:46:55-07:00","id":1143766,"title":"","content":"The Stunned tilt works by dealing damage at least equal to the targets Size. Knockout Artist makes it Size-1.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>SWTOR Referal: <a href=\"http://www.swtor.com/r/JQ2nqy\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.swtor.com/r/JQ2nqy</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/414-gallus","name":"Gallus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar414_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"886"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}